<title>PERU: SOCCER-SPORTING CRISTAL, CRUZEIRO TIE IN SOUTH AMERICAN FINAL.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SPORTING CRISTAL, CRUZEIRO TIE IN SOUTH AMERICAN FINAL.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peru's Sporting Cristal and</p>
<p>Brazil's Cruzeiro drew 0-0 (halftime 0-0) in the first leg of</p>
<p>the final of South America's premier club competition, the</p>
<p>Libertadores Cup.</p>
<p>Attendance: 45,000</p>
</text>
